// Local vendored copy of buildliming/moonbit_image — a pure-MoonBit
// image decoder covering BMP / QOI / TGA / PNG / GIF / JPEG. The
// upstream package publishes as `shunge/image` on the moon registry
// but the network here can't reach it, so we bundle the source for
// reproducibility. Original copyright (c) 2025 lws — MIT license.
//
// Key API surface used by the labeler extension:
//   - detect_format(data) -> ImageFormat?    // already exposed via Image::decode
//   - decode(data)         -> Image raise   // one-call entry point
//   - decode_*             -> Image raise   // per-format decoders
//   - image_dimensions(data) -> (w, h, fmt)
//   - to_rgba8(self)       -> Image         // cheap (bulk-loop) format conversion
//   - resize_nearest/bilinear(self, w, h) -> Image
//   - encode(img, format)  -> Bytes         // only BMP / QOI write paths
// Image struct: { width, height, format : PixelFormat, data : Bytes }
// PixelFormat: Gray8 / GrayA8 / RGB8 / RGBA8 (after to_rgba8() always RGBA8).
